        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\n\nBerlin is our stage tonight, and five targets have been marked for removal.\nThree must be consumed by fire, their ends swallowed in flames without room for escape.\nThe remaining two are to be erased through carefully arranged explosive accidents, leaving nothing but chaos and confusion behind.\n\nThere is one final condition: every action must be carried out while wearing the identity of Agent Chamberlin. No disguises, no substitutions—become the man, and let Berlin believe Chamberlin himself delivered judgment.\n\nPrecision, patience, and perfect timing will be essential.\nGood luck, 47.",
